{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026COTVlRh4TL1795519058.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地持續受冷空氣影響，東部地區普遍降溫，在山東煙台，近日頻頻出現「海滋」奇觀。</p><p></p><p>在蓬萊海域見到海島好像「懸空」，浮在水面上，這是海水與近海面空氣溫差較大，光線穿過密度不同的空氣層時產生折射等，令島嶼等景物出現變形的視覺效果。</p><p></p><p><strong>中央氣象台指多地降溫有雨雪</strong></p><p></p><p>中央氣象台稱，江淮、江南東部，華南南部、雲南東部等地，出現四至六攝氏度降溫。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.COLD-1600-1_CLEAN_20261124_190245_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ydIjQbWq1S1795519067.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>新一輪冷空氣周四至周六影響北方</strong></p><p></p><p>西藏東部、川西高原等部分地區，有中到大雪及雨夾雪，西南、華南等地有小到中雨。雲南局部地區有大到暴雨。並預料周四到周六，又有新一輪冷空氣，影響北方地區。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T12:04:10.983683+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:17.344132+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:57:17.966243+00:00","content_hash":"e5abd1f7827c51370f6377e480bbd381b7d1542078bac2bec229a07879c01d41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}